    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30319" root="علق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَعَلِّقَاتٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَلُّقَاتٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ المُتَعَلِّقُ كَالمُتَأَنِّقِ</span>
means <i>He who is content with what is little is
not like him who seeks, pursues,</i> or <i>desires, the
most pleasing of things,</i> or <i>who is dainty,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْ</span>

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَأَنَّقُ</span>,) <i>and eats what he pleases.</i> (S, O, K.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَأَنِّقٌ</span>.]

